OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and mostly dry in
OL,6,Fthe east through the day, though
OL,7,Fbecoming cloudier through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Cloudy in the west with
OL,9,Fsome showery outbreaks of rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening with some light showers.
OL,13,FPersistent and occasionally heavy rain
OL,14,Fspreads east to all parts overnight.
OL,15,FSome blustery winds developing at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
