OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with
OL,6,Fpersistent and occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain, and some blustery winds at
OL,8,Ftimes. This clears through the morning
OL,9,Fto allow increasing bright spells, and
OL,10,Fsome showers in east.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,13,Fand bright Thursday morning, then
OL,14,Fcloud and rain passing southeast in
OL,15,Fthe evening. Friday will become dry
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells. Mostly dry, bright
OL,17,FSaturday, some showers in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
